    "# Q2 (CLEAN): Urban Sound Classification — Self-contained Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "This cleaned notebook contains the self-contained implementations for the UrbanSound8K experiments: dataset, preprocessing (mel-spectrogram), CNN and Wav2Vec-like models, training loop, evaluation and sanity tests. It is safe to run top-to-bottom."
   ]
